  "steps": [
    "Heat the oven to 180 °C (170 °C fan) and line a 20 cm square pan.",
    "Sift the flour, baking powder, baking soda and salt.",
    "Cream the butter and sugar until fluffy, add the eggs one at a time, then the lemon zest and juice.",
    "Fold in the dry ingredients and the yogurt-milk mixture in batches.",
    "Toss the blueberries in a little flour and fold them in. Spread in the pan.",
    "Bake 30–40 minutes, until a toothpick comes out clean. Cool, then drizzle with the glaze and blueberry sauce."
  ]
